:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle ran 50% of normal for October to November and 45% for November to December. So far in 2026 it has run 43% for March to April and 64% for April to May. Grid 19998 had its driest year in 1963 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
